  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When revealed on a battlefield that spans thousands of li, Pacifying Soul Lake is calm with no ripples, motionless like a mirror even under golden light.",
      "chapters": [
        2193
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Not Immortal cites The Legends of Ren Zu: after Verdant Great Sun died, his soul went to the Door of Life and Death and stayed in pacifying soul lake as reputation Gu left him.",
      "chapters": [
        1189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_not_immortal",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "char_verdant_great_sun",
        "loc_door_of_life_and_death",
        "gu_reputation_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the periphery of that cleared battlefield, Pacifying Soul Lake appears with a majestic mountain range beside it, so tall and vast it seems to touch the sky and spread beyond sight. Observers note that The Legends of Ren Zu has no records of that mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2193
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shore-and-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the Door of Life and Death, Spectral Soul Demon Venerable sits cross-legged while Pacifying Soul Lake is only a puddle in comparison to his scale.",
      "chapters": [
        2195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-souls-domain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "According to Spectral Soul’s memories and The Legends of Ren Zu, Ren Zu’s eldest son Verdant Great Sun’s soul lay on the shores of Pacifying Soul Lake. Around the lake at that later moment there is nothing, and Fang Yuan judges it likely that Verdant Great Sun’s soul was devourable by Spectral Soul Demon Venerable. Fang Yuan later says that if he also had Pacifying Soul Lake besides Dang Hun Mountain and Luo Po Valley, he might restrain all soul path methods completely.",
      "chapters": [
        2197
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "verdant-great-suns-soul",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
